  "notes": [
    "Window regressions ran before the internal TimeGrid overflow change. The four final renderer journeys ran on both devices after that change; existing Month/inspector paths were not changed by it.",
    "Boolean presentation failed to open. Item-based presentation fixed opening. Subsequent failures exposed native List virtualization and an incorrect Button query for source Schedule rows. Traversal and actual accessibility types corrected those fixtures. Tablet popover variants remained invisible despite nonzero outer bounds; a zero-sized hosting ancestor clipped them. Final overflow uses one item-based native sheet attached to the stable grid root.",
    "Earlier Mac runtime evidence records a runner startup hang before any native journey executed. This slice compiles the app/test host and does not claim Mac runtime qualification."
  ],
  "remainingGates": [
    "Week clock alignment on short/long days, repeated-hour descriptions and travel",
    "Per-device calendar display-zone override",
    "Mac runtime, keyboard, VoiceOver, Dynamic Type and additional responsive layouts",
    "Storage-scale performance, physical sync/account/recovery/Share and whole-app polish"
  ],
